 244               /  Q-OVERLAY    41      5600-6200       ", O, SKPSET
 245               /  E-OVERLAY    42      6200-6600       ERROR MESSAGE PROCESSOR
 246               /  X-OVERLAY    43      6600-7200       EX,EC,EG,EK,EF (EA,EI,EN,EP)
 247               /  F-OVERLAY    44      7200-7600       ED,EH,EO,ES,ET,EU (EV)
