 263               /IN CORE.  IF IT IS NOT 0, THEN THIS LOCATION CONTAINS THE
 264               /BLOCK NUMBER TO READ IN THAT OVERLAY.
 265               /THUS EACH OVERLAY HAS POINTERS TO ALL THE OTHER OVERLAYS.
